    {
      "id": null,
      "key": "panel1340DF7CA3BA2949",
      "title": "Recommendations Summary",
      "visualSettings": "{\"general\":{\"mode\":\"TextPanel\",\"type\":\"text\",\"displayType\":\"default\"},\"text\":{\"format\":\"markdownV2\",\"fontSize\":12,\"backgroundColor\":\"#003816\",\"textColor\":\"white\"},\"series\":{},\"legend\":{\"enabled\":false},\"title\":{\"fontSize\":18}}",
      "keepVisualSettingsConsistentWithParent": true,
      "panelType": "TextPanel",
      "text": "Rules whose severity is increased are expected to contribute to additional insights. However, the incremental insights will lack analyst labels (e.g. Resolved, False Positive) and are tabulated as *Unlabeled* insights. Conversely, rules whose severity is reduced will reduce insight counts.\n\n- **Eligible Insights :** Total number of eligible insights prior to optimization.\n- **Optimized Labeled Insights (OLI) :** Labeled insights if all severity changes are applied.\n- **Forecasted Unlabeled Insights (FUI) :** Unlabeled resulting from rules with severity increases.\n- **Total Optimized Insights :** Total labeled and unlabeled insights insights if all severity changes are applied.\n\n\n\n"
    },
