      "keepVisualSettingsConsistentWithParent": true,
      "panelType": "TextPanel",
      "text": "* Signal Volume - number of signals in which the rule participated over the time range indicated\n* Eligible: | Resolved - count | FP - count | NA - count | by Rule\n* Optimized (if recommended severity changes are applied): | Resolved - count | FP - count | NA - count | by Rule\n*  Tunability [0-100]: Scores closer to 100 identify rules that will benefit from Tuning Expressions because a small number of entities dominate False Positive and No Action insights. Click on tunability link to view and download list of entities."
    },
    {
      "id": null,
      "key": "panel8AF3AD65A96C8942",
      "title": "",
      "visualSettings": "{\"general\":{\"mode\":\"TextPanel\",\"type\":\"text\",\"displayType\":\"default\"},\"series\":{},\"legend\":{\"enabled\":false},\"title\":{\"fontSize\":23},\"text\":{\"format\":\"markdownV2\",\"fontSize\":12,\"backgroundColor\":\"#003e59\",\"textColor\":\"white\",\"showTitle\":false}}",
      "keepVisualSettingsConsistentWithParent": true,
      "panelType": "TextPanel",
      "text": "## Eligible Algorithmic Insights\n\nThe funnel depicts Algorithmic insights that remain after filtering insights based on\n* date range\n* insights containing dynamic severity rules\n* non-algorithmic detection i.e. Rule and User insights\n* duplicate insights\n* data completeness"
    },
    {
      "id": null,
      "key": "panelA0FBDAA2AD790A43",
      "title": "Recommended Rule Severities",
      "visualSettings": "{\"general\":{\"mode\":\"TextPanel\",\"type\":\"text\",\"displayType\":\"default\"},\"text\":{\"format\":\"markdownV2\",\"fontSize\":12,\"backgroundColor\":\"#61003d\",\"textColor\":\"white\"},\"series\":{},\"legend\":{\"enabled\":false},\"title\":{\"fontSize\":18}}",
      "keepVisualSettingsConsistentWithParent": true,
      "panelType": "TextPanel",
      "text": "The following table tabulates shows rules that are recommended for severity changes based on their impact on Resolved, False Positive and No Action insights. Rules with recommended severity decreases participate in False Positive / No Actions insights more frequently than rules that are recommended for severity increases. Before changing rule severities, check for the rule's tunability score. Rules with high tunability scores are likely to benefit from Tuning Expressions because a small number of entities cause a significant share of False Positive and No Action insights."
    },
    {
      "id": null,
      "key": "panelPANE-180C2C6CB6DAE94D",
      "title": " About",
      "visualSettings": "{\"general\":{\"mode\":\"TextPanel\",\"type\":\"text\",\"displayType\":\"default\"},\"text\":{\"format\":\"markdownV2\",\"fontSize\":12,\"backgroundColor\":\"#4c4282\",\"textColor\":\"white\"},\"series\":{},\"legend\":{\"enabled\":false},\"title\":{\"fontSize\":18}}",
      "keepVisualSettingsConsistentWithParent": true,
      "panelType": "TextPanel",
      "text": "Tuning rules to maximize effectiveness of detections is a key strategy to help incident responders focus on the most important threats. Use this dashboard to get rule tuning recommendations learned from the potential to reduce False Positive Insights and optionally, No Action Insights, given *algorithmic* insights data for the indicated date range. Time range for panels in this dashboard are set to the dates in the Date Range panel. Changing dashboard time ranges will not affect the results.\n\nFor best results, customers are expected to investigate and respond to incidents using Sumo Logic Cloud SIEM and close Insights with appropriate resolution status. \n\nInsight Trainer assumes the following definitions of Insight resolution status:\n1) False positive - a false alarm, possibly due to an error in the detection logic of the rule or inapplicability to your environment\n2) No Action - a valid detection but no action is necessary due to effective containment measures. Rules participating in repeated No Action Insights may also be  good tuning expression candidates.\n3) Resolved - a valid detection where investigation is necessary"
    }
